<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pharmacia 1997 estimate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pharmacia 1997 estimate cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co pharmceutical industry analyst Ian Sanderson said he lowered his 1997 earnings estimate for Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc to $2.15 per share from $2.23 per share.</p>
<p>-- Sanderson said he made the adjustment based on the company's comments Wednesday following release of its fourth quarter and 1996 financial results.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the drugmaker were off 7/8 to 36-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Kevin Drawbaugh, Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
